</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">In <em id="bib.bib49.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Proceedings of the 2025 Conference of the Nations of the Americas Chapter of the Association for Computational Linguistics: Human Language Technologies (Volume 1: Long Papers)</em>.

